Because it's made up of two charts and we only have 20

26
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:07,000
minutes to write with a minimum word count of 150, each chart

27
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:11,580
of this type will be simpler and less detailed compared to the

28
00:02:11,580 --> 00:02:13,600
one in a single chart question.

29
00:02:14,350 --> 00:02:19,060
Let's recall the three steps of chart analysis in task one, which

30
00:02:19,060 --> 00:02:23,380
