31
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:30,220
The big three, the great three, and the major three.

32
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:37,240
Firstly, please analyze the big three, including the title of the chart

33
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:44,880
to identify what and where, the y-axis to identify unit, the

34
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:51,800
x-axis to identify time or category, group of information in the charts.

35
00:02:52,400 --> 00:03:03,080
Then find the great three, including subjects of comparison, global trend, if any, and global feature.

36
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:08,220
Please pause the video for 10 minutes and analyze the charts according

37
00:03:08,220 --> 00:03:09,580
to the two steps above.

38
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:11,760
Your time starts now.

39
00:03:17,530 --> 00:03:20,370
Following the big three, here is what we have found.

